<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic
        SYSTEM "https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/xhtml-entities.dtd">
<topic xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/topic.v2.xsd"
       title="/manage-score" id="manage-score">

    <tldr>
        <p>
            <format style="italic">Manually adjust the score of service team members for carry types.</format>
        </p>

        <p><br/></p>

        <p>
            <format style="bold">Allowed in DMs:</format>
            :x: No
        </p>

        <p>
            <format style="bold">Default permission required:</format>
            <code>Manage Messages</code>
        </p>
    </tldr>

    <chapter title="Description" id="description">
        <p>
            Score tracks carry service contributions by service team members. It is normally awarded automatically via the
            <a href="log.topic">/log</a> command when carries are completed. This command allows administrators to manually
            adjust scores for edge cases, corrections, or special circumstances.
        </p>
        <p>
            Score adjustments affect <a href="leaderboard.topic">leaderboards</a> and can be viewed with <a href="score.topic">/score</a>.
        </p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Permissions" id="permissions">
        <p>
            The <code>add</code> and <code>remove</code> sub-commands require the <code>Manage Messages</code> Discord permission.
            If the <code>SCORE_MANAGEMENT_ROLE</code> <a href="Server-Property.md">server property</a> is configured, users
            must also have that role to use these commands.
        </p>
        <p>
            The <code>reset</code> sub-command requires the <code>Administrator</code> Discord permission due to its server-wide impact.
        </p>
        <p>
            Server administrators can override these default permission requirements using Discord's command permission settings.
        </p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Sub-Commands" id="sub-commands">
        <list>
            <li><a href="manage-score-add.topic"/>: Give score to a service team member.</li>
            <li><a href="manage-score-remove.topic"/>: Remove score from a service team member.</li>
            <li><a href="manage-score-reset.topic"/>: Reset all scores for a given carry type.</li>
        </list>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="See Also" id="see-also">
        <list>
            <li><a href="log.topic">/log</a>: Normal way to earn score by logging carries</li>
            <li><a href="score.topic">/score</a>: View a user's current score</li>
            <li><a href="leaderboard.topic">/leaderboard</a>: View score rankings</li>
            <li><a href="Server-Property.md">Server Properties</a>: Configure <code>SCORE_MANAGEMENT_ROLE</code> and <code>SCORE_LOGS_CHANNEL</code></li>
        </list>
    </chapter>
</topic>